          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n<style>\\n/* Zen minimal, sensory-focused palette */\\n:root{--bg1:#f8fbfa;--bg2:#eef6f5;--accent1:#1d8b83;--accent2:#2aa39b;--ink:#052;--muted:#284}\\nbody { margin:0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; color:var(--ink); background: linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2)); min-height:100vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }\\n.header { position:relative; padding:28px 24px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; z-index:5; }\\n.brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }\\n.logo { width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:12px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dbeff0,#f9f6ff); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,32,0.06); }\\n.logo svg { width:34px; height:34px; filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)); }\\n.nav { display:flex; gap:18px; align-items:center; }\\n.nav a { color:#0b2a2a; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; opacity:0.9; }\\n.hero { position:relative; padding:64px 24px 40px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 420px; gap:36px; align-items:start; max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; width:100%; }\\n.card { background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.7)); border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(11,30,30,0.06); padding:28px; }\\n.h-title { font-size:28px; margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--ink); }\\n.h-sub { margin:0 0 18px; color:#264; opacity:0.85; }\\n.lead { color:#123; line-height:1.6; }\\n.pattern-wrap { position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none; opacity:0.85; }\\n.pattern-svg { width:100%; height:100%; display:block; transform:translateY(-6%); }\\n.form { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }\\n.input, textarea, select { width:100%; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e0efee; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size:14px; color:#063; box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }\\n.textarea { min-height:140px; resize:vertical; }\\n.row { display:flex; gap:12px; }\\n.small { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); }\\n.submit { background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent2),var(--accent1)); color:white; border:none; padding:12px 16px; font-weight:700; border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer; }\\n.info { font-size:13px; color:#144; }\\n.section { max-width:1080px; margin:22px auto; padding:18px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 360px; gap:28px; }\\n.section h3 { margin:0 0 8px; color:#073; }\\n.list { background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffd); padding:18px; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(8,20,20,0.04); }\\n.faq-item { border-top:1px dashed rgba(4,40,40,0.06); padding:12px 0; }\\n.footer { padding:28px 24px; text-align:center; color:#093; font-size:13px; }\\n@media(max-width:880px){ .hero{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } .section{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } .nav{ display:none; } }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n<svg class=\\\"pattern-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 400\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n<defs>\\n<linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n<stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e7fbf8\\\"/>\\n<stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f6f7ff\\\"/>\\n</linearGradient>\\n<pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(15)\\\">\\n<rect width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n<circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"2.8\\\" fill=\\\"#d2f0ec\\\" opacity=\\\"0.8\\\"/>\\n<circle cx=\\\"44\\\" cy=\\\"46\\\" r=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"#eaf7f5\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n<path d=\\\"M0 60 Q20 48 40 60\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#cfeee9\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" opacity=\\\"0.7\\\"/>\\n</pattern>\\n<filter id=\\\"soft\\\" x=\\\"-50%\\\" y=\\\"-50%\\\" width=\\\"200%\\\" height=\\\"200%\\\">\\n<feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"18\\\" result=\\\"b\\\" />\\n<feBlend in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\" in2=\\\"b\\\" mode=\\\"normal\\\"/>\\n</filter>\\n</defs>\\n<rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" filter=\\\"url(#soft)\\\"/>\\n<g opacity=\\\"0.6\\\" transform=\\\"translate(560,30) rotate(18)\\\">\\n<ellipse rx=\\\"180\\\" ry=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.8\\\"/>\\n<g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#c4f0e8\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" opacity=\\\"0.5\\\">\\n<path d=\\\"M-80 0 C -20 -30 20 -10 80 -20\\\"/>\\n<path d=\\\"M-60 20 C 0 -10 30 10 100 30\\\"/>\\n</g>\\n</g>\\n</svg>\\n</div>\\n\\n<header class=\\\"header\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n<svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n<defs>\\n<linearGradient id=\\\"lg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8ee3d6\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#dbe7ff\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n</defs>\\n<rect width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"url(#lg)\\\"/>\\n<path d=\\\"M16 40 C26 30 38 28 48 20\\\" stroke=\\\"#045\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n</svg>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\\"font-weight:800; color:#042;\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n<div style=\\\"font-size:12px; color:#2b6;\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<nav class=\\\"nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Gather</a>\\n<a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Rituals</a>\\n<a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Sessions</a>\\n<a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Membership</a>\\n<a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n<a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Questions</a>\\n<a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach</a>\\n</nav>\\n</header>\\n\\n<main>\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-heading\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n<h1 id=\\\"contact-heading\\\" class=\\\"h-title\\\">Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"h-sub\\\">{{TAGLINE}} — an invitation to slow down and listen.</p>\\n<p class=\\\"lead\\\">We're here for questions about membership, private sound work, or upcoming gatherings. Whether you're curious about what a sound bath feels like or you want to reserve space for the whole team, the path starts with a hello.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:14px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center;\\\">\\n<a class=\\\"submit\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n<a style=\\\"display:inline-block; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:10px; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(5,20,20,0.04); text-decoration:none; color:#065;\\\" href=\\\"events.html\\\">Next Ritual</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:18px; color:#0a3; font-size:13px;\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\">Phone</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\"><a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit; text-decoration:none;\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n<div style=\\\"font-weight:700; margin-top:8px;\\\">Email</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit; text-decoration:none;\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n<form class=\\\"form\\\" action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n<input class=\\\"input\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required/>\\n<input class=\\\"input\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required/>\\n<div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n<input class=\\\"input\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\"/>\\n<select name=\\\"interest\\\" class=\\\"input\\\" aria-label=\\\"Interest\\\">\\n<option value=\\\"membership\\\">Membership</option>\\n<option value=\\\"events\\\">Upcoming events</option>\\n<option value=\\\"private\\\">Private session</option>\\n</select>\\n</div>\\n<textarea class=\\\"textarea\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"How can we support you? Dates, size, questions...\\\" aria-label=\\\"Message\\\"></textarea>\\n<label class=\\\"small\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"subscribe\\\"/> Join our membership waitlist and updates</label>\\n<button class=\\\"submit\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send inquiry</button>\\n</form>\\n\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px; font-size:13px; color:#123;\\\" class=\\\"info\\\">\\n<strong>Location</strong><br/>\\n{{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}<br/>\\n<strong>Facilitator</strong><br/>{{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\n</div>\\n</aside>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"ritual-heading\\\">\\n<div>\\n<h3 id=\\\"ritual-heading\\\">Ritual & Flow</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"lead\\\">Each gathering is a carefully arranged arc of arrival, immersion, and gentle return. We begin with a guided settling — soft breath and intention setting — followed by a layered soundscape using crystal bowls, a deep gong, and chimes to support shifting attention. You are invited to lie down, soften, and let the frequencies wash through. Sessions close with space for reflection and light movement.</p>\\n\\n<h3 style=\\\"margin-top:14px;\\\">What to bring</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n<ul style=\\\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; color:#113;\\\">\\n<li>Yoga mat, blanket, and a pillow for comfort</li>\\n<li>Water bottle and any small comforts (eye pillow encouraged)</li>\\n<li>Wear layers for warmth; socks are helpful</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h3 style=\\\"margin-top:14px;\\\">Contraindications & safety</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"lead\\\">Sound baths are deeply relaxing but not suitable for everyone. If you are pregnant, have seizures, are fitted with a pacemaker, are in acute psychiatric crisis, or have serious cardiovascular conditions, please consult your medical provider before attending. Contact us directly for modifications — safety and care are central to our practice.</p>\\n</div>\\n\\n<aside>\\n<div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n<h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;\\\">Quick details</h4>\\n<div style=\\\"font-size:13px; color:#072;\\\">\\n<strong>Format:</strong> Group events & private sessions<br/>\\n<strong>Typical length:</strong> 75–90 minutes<br/>\\n<strong>Instruments:</strong> Crystal bowls, gong, chimes, tuning forks (varied each event)<br/>\\n<strong>Next event:</strong> {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;\\\" class=\\\"list\\\">\\n<h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;\\\">Accessibility</h4>\\n<p style=\\\"margin:0; font-size:13px; color:#084;\\\">We offer chair options and accessible entry at {{VENUE_NAME}}. Please notify us when booking so we can prepare the space.</p>\\n</div>\\n</aside>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n<div>\\n<h3 id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Common questions</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\">Do I need experience with meditation?</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\">No — these gatherings are for beginners and experienced practitioners alike. The sounds guide the experience; you simply rest.</div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n<div style=\\\"font-weight:700;\\\">Can I bring a friend?</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\">Yes — we welcome shared experiences. For couples or corporate bookings, inquire about private sessions.</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<aside>\\n<div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n<h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;\\\">Booking note</h4>\\n<p style=\\\"margin:0; font-size:13px;\\\">To secure a spot or ask about membership benefits, use the main contact form or ring us at <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;\\\" class=\\\"list\\\">\\n<h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;\\\">Privacy</h4>\\n<p style=\\\"margin:0; font-size:13px; color:#0b3;\\\">We keep inquiries confidential and will never share personal details. By contacting {{BUSINESS_NAME}} you agree to hear from us about bookings and membership information.</p>\\n</div>\\n</aside>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"footer\\\">\\n<p>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-top:6px;\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — curated sound experiences. Memberships available — <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700; color:#053;\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></p>\\n</footer>\\n</main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Project chunk: contact + README\\n\\nNiche: Sound Bath Events (sound_bath)\\nSlug: sound_bath-2026-02-16T13-21-11-585Z-031\\nSeed: 2770853913\\nLayout family: zen_minimal\\nVoice: warm_storyteller\\nOffer model: membership\\n\\nFiles included in this chunk:\\n- contact.html (primary contact page for the site)\\n- README.md (this file)\\n\\nPurpose\\n- contact.html is a sensory, premium contact page tailored for a sound bath events site. It contains an accessible contact form, membership CTA, practical details (what to bring, contraindications), flow description, quick event details, and a small FAQ.\\n\\nDesign notes\\n- Visual richness is created through CSS gradients, layered card surfaces and an inline SVG background pattern. No external assets or CDNs are used.\\n- The background SVG is embedded directly in contact.html (the unique pattern lives inside the page). If you prefer a dedicated asset, extract the <svg> to assets/img/pattern.svg and reference it as needed.\\n- Navigation labels are intentionally varied (Gather, Rituals, Sessions, Membership, Our Story, Questions, Reach) to meet the uniqueness requirement across site pages.\\n- The page includes placeholders that must be replaced by your templating system or a simple search/replace:\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n  - {{TAGLINE}}\\n  - {{PHONE}}\\n  - {{EMAIL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n  - {{CITY}}\\n  - {{STATE}}\\n  - {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\n  - {{VENUE_NAME}}\\n  - {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n\\nAccessibility & UX\\n- Form fields include labels via placeholders and aria attributes for clarity.\\n- Color contrast kept high for primary text; decorative SVG includes aria-hidden to avoid noise for assistive tech.\\n- Mobile queries collapse the grid to a single column and hide the full nav for clarity.\\n\\nBehavior\\n- The contact form uses a mailto action for demo purposes; in production replace the form action with your API endpoint or form handling service.\\n\\nHow to use\\n1. Drop contact.html into your site root or template folder.\\n2. Replace placeholders with actual values or wire up your templating engine.\\n3. If you want the background as a standalone file, extract the inline SVG block to assets/img/pattern.svg and reference it with CSS or an <img> tag.\\n\\nChunk rules compliance\\n- Contains sensory language, what to bring, contraindications, and flow description.\\n- Membership CTA is prominent and links to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n- Instruments vary and are listed (crystal bowls, gong, chimes, tuning forks).\\n\\nEditing tips\\n- To change the instrument list or event details, edit the quick details block.\\n- To adapt the tone, update the copy in the hero and ritual sections.\\n\\nContact\\n- For further iterations (other pages in the site), replicate the visual patterns and vary headings/structure to maintain uniqueness across templates.\\n\\nEnd of README.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
